# Tutorial 05 — hosted openings: windows and doors in the Cedar House walls.
title: Doors and windows
summary: Placing windows and doors in walls, types, sizes, openings and flipping
---
speed 18
open new
runfile setup/cedar-walls.scr
zoom window -2500,-2500 23500,12000
caption "Windows" "WINDOW places a window where you pick a wall"
type WINDOW Width 2400 Height 1100 Sill 900
pick 1500,1500
enter
wait 1.5
caption "Sizes by option" "Width, Height and Sill: a tall window high in the wall"
type WINDOW Width 2400 Height 1500 Sill 3800 4300,1500 ;
type WINDOW Width 2200 Height 1100 Sill 900 0,6500 ;
type WINDOW Width 3000 Height 2400 Sill 300 3000,10000 ;
wait 1
caption "The cedar tower" "A 5.3 m glazing strip and a high window"
type WINDOW Width 1300 Height 5300 Sill 1600 7650,0 ;
type WINDOW Width 1600 Height 1400 Sill 4200 8500,7500 ;
wait 1
caption "Door types" "The Type option lists the door types of the project"
type DOOR Type ?
escape
wait 1
caption "The entrance" "A 1100 × 2700 pivot door, full-height glazing and a sidelight"
type DOOR Width 1100 Height 2700
pick 16300,3200
enter
type WINDOW Width 900 Height 2900 Sill 0 11700,3200 ;
type WINDOW Width 600 Height 2700 Sill 0 17250,3200 ;
type WINDOW Width 1500 Height 2800 Sill 200 18900,3200 ;
zoom window 10500,1500 20500,6000
wait 1
caption "Flipping" "OPENINGFLIP turns a door to open the other way"
type OPENINGFLIP
pick 16300,3200
enter
wait 1
zoom extents
caption "Openings" "OPENING cuts an empty doorway in the partition"
type OPENING Width 1800 Height 2400 Sill 0 14600,6600 ;
type WINDOW Width 1400 Height 1400 Sill 4300 15100,5600 ;
wait 1
caption "In 3D" "Openings cut through their walls and move with them"
click mode 3D
wait 1
type SEISO
orbit 40 3
click mode 2D
caption "Next: floors, roofs and stairs" "Tutorial 06 closes the house"
wait 3
